  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "經濟學導論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO ECONOMICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將介紹經濟學的基本問題、價格機能的運作、市場效率的衡量、及政府各種價格與數量管制措施對市場效率的影響，再介紹消費者行為及選擇、廠商的生產與成本理論、以及不同市場結構下廠商的訂價行為。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will introduce the fundamental economic problems, operations of price mechanism, measurement of market efficiency, and the influence of alternative controls in price and quantity of government on market efficiency, then will introduce consumer behaviors and choice, production and cost theories of firm, and the pricing behaviors of firms under different market structures.",
